# Goal
nav_msgs/Path path                 # Initial path to be smoothed
float32 smoothing_factor           # Factor controlling the level of smoothing (0 to 1)

---
# Result
bool success                       # Whether the path smoothing succeeded
nav_msgs/Path smoothed_path        # Smoothed path
string message                     # Optional message for debugging or failure

---
# Feedback
float32 progress                   # Progress of the smoothing operation (0.0 to 1.0)
